message: "If you use ProFast-Net in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ProFast-Net"
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform network supervisor: focus a workload, inventory listening
  sockets, defend the host with tarpits and escalating bans, and require an
  explicit consent token before terminating anything. Control plane in Python,
  daemon in Go, cryptographic core in C++17.
